<a name="toc_tc71662"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4519: Verify Filter functionality by site and conveyor&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uig84184</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br />Verify Filter functionality by site and conveyor </td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br />User is logged into mobile application</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td>Verify user login to Mobile application as Master user</td><td>Belt Scan card should be displayed on home level</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td>Verify user click on Belt Scan card</td><td>Belt Scan list page should be displayed</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td>Verify user is able to see all the Belt Scan(mentioned in the pre-condition) in mobile application that was added through web from home level</td><td>User should be able to view all the Belt Scan(mentioned in the pre-condition) in mobile application that was added through web from home level</td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td>Verify user view the Belt Scan order</td><td>User should view the Belt Scan in mobile application in the same order as it is in web</td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td>Verify the sort functionality</td><td>Belt Scan should be sorted by last modified, ascending and descending order</td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td><p>Verify filter functionality</p>
</td><td><p>User should be able to apply filter to the Belt Scan based on Site and conveyor that has belt scan record</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td><p>Verify based on the selected site conveyor is filtered</p>
</td><td><p>Based on selected site, conveyor should be filtered (This will display site and conveyor data having only belt scan record)</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">8</td><td>Verify user clear the filter from home level</td><td>Filters should be cleared and all the belt scan record should be displayed</td></tr><tr><td width="5">9</td><td>Verify user is able to see all the Belt Scan(mentioned in the pre-condition) in mobile application that was added through web from conveyor level</td><td>User should be able to view all the Belt Scan(mentioned in the pre-condition) in mobile application that was added through web from conveyor level</td></tr><tr><td width="5">10</td><td>Verify user view the Belt Scan Belt Scan order from conveyor level</td><td>User should view the conveyor level Belt Scan in mobile application in the same order as it is in web</td></tr><tr><td width="5">11</td><td>Verify the sort functionality</td><td>Belt Scan should be sorted by last modified, ascending and descending order</td></tr><tr><td width="5">12</td><td><p>Verify filter functionality</p>
</td><td><p>User should be disabledwith conveyor anf site field as it is already filtered only device type should be enabled</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">13</td><td><p>Verify device type filter</p>
</td><td><p>Based device type selected filter should be applied</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">14</td><td>Verify user clear the filter from conveyor level</td><td>Filters should be cleared and only belt scan with selected conveyor should be displayed</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
